"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  suppressionRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxTouchpoints24h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    minIntervalBetweenChannels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 240</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    stopOnPurchase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    stopOnUnsubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    globalCooldownDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  attribution</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'last_touch'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'first_touch'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'linear'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lookbackWindow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道组合</th>\n<th>预期挽回率</th>\n<th>成本/挽回订单</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅邮件</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.50</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.50-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>2</td>\n<td>基础方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮件+推送</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>3</td>\n<td>App用户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮件+推送+短信</td>\n<td>15-20%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>5</td>\n<td>高客单价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全渠道（含广告）</td>\n<td>20-25%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>8</td>\n<td>大型电商</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>购物车放弃率平均 70%，额外费用过高（49%）和强制注册（24%）是两大主因</li>\n<li>漏斗分析定位具体流失步骤，热力图和会话回放揭示表单层面的用户痛点</li>\n<li>3 封系列挽回邮件（1h/24h/72h）逐步升级刺激强度，个性化内容显著提升转化率</li>\n<li>退出意图弹窗和实时库存预警是站内即时挽回的高效手段</li>\n<li>跨渠道协同挽回率可达 20-25%，但需严格控制触达频率避免用户反感</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"购物车放弃与挽回策略","id":"购物车放弃与挽回策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"放弃行为数据分析","id":"放弃行为数据分析"},{"level":2,"text":"邮件挽回系统","id":"邮件挽回系统"},{"level":2,"text":"实时挽回触发器","id":"实时挽回触发器"},{"level":2,"text":"跨渠道协同挽回","id":"跨渠道协同挽回"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"收银台流程设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/checkout-optimization/checkout-flow-design"},"next":{"title":"一键支付与快捷结账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/checkout-optimization/one-click-payment"}}